WEBVTT

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:07.402
No one can stop the flow of time...

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:16.110
...but a moment captured in a
picture will never disappear.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:35.730
It will decorate your heart
and always stir your soul...

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:38.336
...sweetly... and longingly...

00:00:56.322 --> 00:01:02.853
Why? Somehow you seem upset
Why? Nandaka ochikonderu mitai

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:11.333
Voice, my voice. I want it to reach you
Voice, my voice. Todoketai yo kimi ni

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:19.938
Things aren't going the way you'd like
Omoi douri ni naranai koto nara

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:28.280
That might happen a lot now, but...
Ima wa takusan attarisuru kedo

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:35.126
Tomorrow, another new wind
Mata ashita wa chigau kaze

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:38.656
will blow your way
fuite kuru yo

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:43.525
Spread your arms and let your chest
Ryoute wo hirogeta mune ni

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:47.029
just feel the breeze
kanjiru mama

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:51.935
No matter what befalls us,
Nani ga osoi kakattemo

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:55.180
no matter how difficult it may be
semetatete mo

00:01:55.982 --> 00:02:02.388
We'll be all right
Watashi tachi wa daijoubu

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:15.858
I Can't Win Even Though I Collect
Every Smile from Around the World

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:19.482
Really? You got a ticket to their live show?

00:02:19.506 --> 00:02:20.837
That's amazing!

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:24.077
I'll go! I'll go! I've always
wanted to see them live.

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:26.475
Yeah. Okay, I'll talk to you later!

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:29.892
AKi, is that your new boyfriend?

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:33.162
Stop kidding around. He's my friend.

00:02:33.186 --> 00:02:34.363
Yeah right...

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:37.466
Anyway, what about you, Chiharu?

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.002
How's it going now that
Kyoichi is your boyfriend?

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:41.619
W-Well...

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:46.429
AKi, you were cute in middle school too!

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:49.301
Look at you acting all shy.

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:50.960
| take that back.

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:52.982
You're so pouty here.

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:57.739
| know! What a picture-perfect moment.

00:02:58.111 --> 00:03:00.307
Hey, what were you angry about Aki?

00:03:02.382 --> 00:03:04.360
Come on. Let's get going...

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:06.978
...or else the Karaoke Box is going to be packed.

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:13.722
Hey, Mizutani.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:14.656
What?

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:16.860
Last shot.

00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:20.663
Are we going to karaoke?

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.139
| guess that should do it.

00:03:38.585 --> 00:03:41.797
| wish it'd stop... I hate rain.

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:44.722
Me too. Rain is the track team's enemy.

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:46.722
I like it.

00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:54.591
| like rain. It feels like it's
cleansing the world, you know?

00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:15.081
Mizutani? Is that you, Mizutani?

00:04:19.392 --> 00:04:20.917
| haven't seen you since middle school.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:21.993
Have you been doing okay?

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:24.428
Yeah... It really is you, Ueno.

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:26.925
You look so different, I couldn't tell.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:28.729
You look different too.

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:30.998
You look so pretty.

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:33.600
You haven't changed.

00:04:34.607 --> 00:04:36.097
Are you still in the photography club?

00:04:36.576 --> 00:04:39.102
Yeah, we have an exhibit soon.

00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:40.940
Everyone's excited.

00:04:42.415 --> 00:04:44.008
Um... Aki?

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:47.884
Oh right. I have to go.

00:04:48.254 --> 00:04:50.165
Okay. I'll call you soon.

00:04:50.189 --> 00:04:51.748
Okay. See you.

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:54.986
Your friend is really cute.

00:04:55.061 --> 00:04:56.605
Introduce me to him next time.

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:57.562
Who is he?

00:04:58.197 --> 00:04:59.631
My ex...

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:01.093
Oh...
Oh...

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:02.625
What?!
What?!

00:05:12.478 --> 00:05:14.071
Are you done yet?

00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:18.661
I wish at least the rain would stop.

00:05:18.685 --> 00:05:20.663
<i>It'd make this a little easier.</i>

00:05:20.687 --> 00:05:22.815
Aki. Is it just the two of you again?

00:05:23.056 --> 00:05:24.933
It must be rough, being
the class president...

00:05:24.957 --> 00:05:27.085
...and having such a stubborn partner.

00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:29.261
Hope you make a great graduation album.

00:05:29.595 --> 00:05:33.327
But you guys look good together,
getting drenched in the rain like that.

00:05:33.866 --> 00:05:34.833
Idiot!

00:05:36.636 --> 00:05:38.195
I'm in love, Mizutani.

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:42.142
It's like the rain is cleansing the
world... it feels good, doesn't it?

00:05:43.276 --> 00:05:44.903
Oh, the rain...

00:05:54.087 --> 00:05:55.664
I think I'm falling in love too.

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:57.053
Right? With the rain.

00:05:59.492 --> 00:06:00.891
Oh, whatever.

00:06:14.273 --> 00:06:15.399
Looks like you're doing good.

00:06:17.744 --> 00:06:19.007
Hey, Aki.

00:06:19.779 --> 00:06:22.612
Can I see? This is
for the exhibit right?

00:06:23.082 --> 00:06:25.561
Huh? You haven't taken any?

00:06:25.585 --> 00:06:28.816
Um... no, I just started...

00:06:29.255 --> 00:06:31.233
| don't want the camera
to get rained on...

00:06:31.257 --> 00:06:32.850
...So maybe I should stop.

00:06:33.126 --> 00:06:33.991
But...

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:38.725
This is bad...

00:06:40.466 --> 00:06:42.025
Let's go. Run!

00:06:49.142 --> 00:06:51.270
Ueno, you're a little different now.

00:06:51.444 --> 00:06:52.104
Really?

00:06:52.211 --> 00:06:55.806
Yeah well... It's probably
because it's been a year.

00:06:56.115 --> 00:06:57.810
You must've grown up a bit.

00:06:59.152 --> 00:07:01.746
Let's go out, AKi.

00:07:02.121 --> 00:07:02.815
Huh?

00:07:09.629 --> 00:07:11.620
Go!

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.463
Damn!

00:07:15.835 --> 00:07:17.200
Yes!

00:07:20.173 --> 00:07:21.197
Come to think of it,

00:07:21.474 --> 00:07:24.842
this is the first time we've
been to an arcade together.

00:07:25.178 --> 00:07:27.156
And we were always together
in middle school, too.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:28.390
Of course.

00:07:28.414 --> 00:07:32.817
You were spending time with
your camera, hot me. Remember?

00:07:33.453 --> 00:07:35.012
Really? I was?

00:07:35.688 --> 00:07:36.746
Listen to you!

00:07:42.495 --> 00:07:44.623
Huh? Is it the last one?

00:07:45.832 --> 00:07:48.143
You used to take my picture a lot but,

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:50.761
that was because it was your last shot.

00:07:53.506 --> 00:07:56.407
| bet you only take your
girlfriend's picture now.

00:07:56.509 --> 00:07:58.807
Girlfriend? I don't have one.

00:07:58.945 --> 00:08:01.277
You don't? I see...

00:08:01.814 --> 00:08:05.444
...don't tell me photography is your girlfriend.

00:08:06.185 --> 00:08:07.311
Photography, eh...

00:08:12.692 --> 00:08:14.236
So, what now?

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.694
Just watch.

00:08:17.697 --> 00:08:19.308
There it is. There it is.

00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:22.063
Then let it settle onto the paper and...

00:08:22.235 --> 00:08:23.134
Is it done?

00:08:23.769 --> 00:08:24.759
Done.

00:08:24.871 --> 00:08:26.032
Yes!

00:08:26.205 --> 00:08:27.434
Kiss.

00:08:31.844 --> 00:08:33.835
M-Mizutani!

00:08:35.748 --> 00:08:39.150
Photography Club

00:08:41.387 --> 00:08:42.786
There we go.

00:08:46.459 --> 00:08:47.790
Nice picture.

00:08:49.862 --> 00:08:53.162
A girlfriend? I don't have one.

00:08:53.499 --> 00:08:56.730
You don't? I see...

00:09:12.385 --> 00:09:13.875
Why are you mad?

00:09:42.682 --> 00:09:44.844
Where is he?

00:09:45.318 --> 00:09:46.728
Aki, what's wrong?

00:09:46.752 --> 00:09:48.880
You're spacing out. You're acting weird.

00:09:50.156 --> 00:09:53.592
It's nothing. Okay, let's go sing!

00:10:43.576 --> 00:10:44.338
Click.

00:10:48.214 --> 00:10:49.238
She's missing?

00:10:49.715 --> 00:10:52.082
In other words, she skipped.

00:10:52.451 --> 00:10:54.429
Why are you guys overreacting?

00:10:54.453 --> 00:10:56.698
But she's been acting strange lately.

00:10:56.722 --> 00:10:59.935
Do you think it's because she saw her ex?

00:10:59.959 --> 00:11:01.017
Her ex...

00:11:01.327 --> 00:11:02.726
What?! Her ex?!

00:11:03.195 --> 00:11:04.060
What does he look like?

00:11:04.497 --> 00:11:07.831
How far did they get? A kiss? Or did they...

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:10.669
Well? Well? Well?! What's wrong?!

00:11:15.474 --> 00:11:18.220
Nishikigaoka High School

00:11:18.244 --> 00:11:20.110
Nishikigaoka High School
Hey, is that you AKi?

00:11:20.646 --> 00:11:21.613
Kumi!

00:11:22.314 --> 00:11:24.408
Long time no see. How have you been?

00:11:25.785 --> 00:11:28.948
Oh, well... Do you know where
the photography club is?

00:11:33.693 --> 00:11:33.935
Photography Club

00:11:33.959 --> 00:11:35.837
Photography Club
He's going to quit? Ueno?

00:11:35.861 --> 00:11:36.020
Photography Club

00:11:36.629 --> 00:11:38.063
He might.

00:11:38.564 --> 00:11:42.432
He's stubborn, so... a lot of things
happened with the seniors.

00:11:42.802 --> 00:11:44.930
We're not even certain he'll show
pictures at the next exhibit.

00:11:45.538 --> 00:11:46.937
That can't be...

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:50.009
He hasn't developed any film lately.

00:11:50.476 --> 00:11:53.275
| doubt he's even taken any pictures.

00:11:54.013 --> 00:11:56.607
He's on the roof right now, but I'm
not sure if he's taking pictures.

00:11:57.616 --> 00:12:02.076
These are his newest pictures,
but they're six months old.

00:12:16.135 --> 00:12:18.035
You look bored.

00:12:28.514 --> 00:12:29.606
Good picture, right?

00:12:30.116 --> 00:12:33.428
This camera and its lens are much better.

00:12:33.452 --> 00:12:35.063
And the film has a higher...

00:12:35.087 --> 00:12:36.316
Who took these?

00:12:42.895 --> 00:12:44.727
| don't think they're good at all.

00:12:45.164 --> 00:12:48.031
They're all cold, expressionless pictures.

00:12:48.768 --> 00:12:52.261
Is it true? Did you really take these? Well?

00:12:58.043 --> 00:12:59.909
| asked the person in charge.

00:13:00.412 --> 00:13:02.524
The hydrangea at the botanical garden...

00:13:02.548 --> 00:13:04.380
...will be in full bloom
either today or tomorrow.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:05.412
So?

00:13:05.951 --> 00:13:07.749
So, you have to do it how.

00:13:08.354 --> 00:13:10.198
You came all this way to tell me that?

00:13:10.222 --> 00:13:13.453
Yes. Come on. Stop taking pictures here.

00:13:20.299 --> 00:13:24.065
The other day, you told me I'd grown up a bit.

00:13:25.037 --> 00:13:26.232
You've gotta be Kidding.

00:13:26.605 --> 00:13:28.835
The only thing that got better is the camera.

00:13:29.508 --> 00:13:30.998
It doesn't have anything to do with my skill.

00:13:31.577 --> 00:13:34.603
You're right. I can't take good pictures.

00:13:42.688 --> 00:13:45.248
| like your pictures.

00:13:45.424 --> 00:13:46.983
| used to like them too.

00:13:47.259 --> 00:13:48.920
You say it in past tense.

00:13:50.863 --> 00:13:52.888
Not me.

00:14:05.744 --> 00:14:08.372
Next. Let's go! Let's go to Nikita!

00:14:09.014 --> 00:14:13.144
Alright! Let's dance til morning! Yay!

00:14:41.714 --> 00:14:44.411
Graduation 1999

00:15:06.305 --> 00:15:08.717
Um... I'm glad about the graduation album.

00:15:08.741 --> 00:15:09.818
It turned out really well.

00:15:09.842 --> 00:15:10.365
Yeah.

00:15:10.943 --> 00:15:12.672
Um... Well...

00:15:14.013 --> 00:15:16.482
You can have this. It's a good picture, so...

00:15:32.698 --> 00:15:34.325
Where do you want to go today?

00:15:34.466 --> 00:15:36.491
I'm sick of going to clubs.

00:15:36.769 --> 00:15:38.713
You're trying too hard, Aki.

00:15:38.737 --> 00:15:40.728
Tell us. What happened?

00:15:40.873 --> 00:15:43.351
| told you. It's nothing.

00:15:43.375 --> 00:15:45.673
What? What? The ex-boyfriend?

00:15:46.812 --> 00:15:48.177
Something happened?

00:15:48.447 --> 00:15:50.091
So, how far did you get?

00:15:50.115 --> 00:15:51.913
Why'd you get back together?

00:15:53.118 --> 00:15:54.829
Hey, where's my pilaf?

00:15:54.853 --> 00:15:56.617
| want another glass of water.

00:15:56.922 --> 00:15:59.823
Yeah, yeah. Water isn't free you know.

00:16:03.128 --> 00:16:05.995
Of course, rain again today...

00:16:06.932 --> 00:16:07.742
Jeez...

00:16:07.766 --> 00:16:08.858
That sucked.

00:16:09.268 --> 00:16:11.600
It suddenly started to rain.

00:16:12.037 --> 00:16:14.282
It's because you guys have bad karma.

00:16:14.306 --> 00:16:14.716
Shut up.
It's because you guys have bad karma.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:15.298
Shut up.

