00:16:37.663 --> 00:16:39.757
What was he taking pictures of?

00:16:39.865 --> 00:16:41.526
Um, I think...

00:16:41.834 --> 00:16:42.777
Hydrangea?

00:16:42.801 --> 00:16:43.927
Y-Yeah.

00:17:39.191 --> 00:17:41.523
Aki. Is it just the two of you again?

00:17:41.994 --> 00:17:43.838
It must be rough, being
the class president...

00:17:43.862 --> 00:17:46.007
...and having such a stubborn a partner.

00:17:46.031 --> 00:17:48.022
Hope you make a great graduation album.

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:52.095
But you guys look good together,
getting drenched in the rain like that.

00:17:52.204 --> 00:17:53.103
Idiot!

00:17:55.074 --> 00:17:56.599
I'm in love, Mizutani.

00:18:10.489 --> 00:18:11.456
Ueno!

00:18:27.739 --> 00:18:29.730
I think I'm falling in love too.

00:18:30.142 --> 00:18:31.667
Right? With the rain.

00:18:33.812 --> 00:18:35.109
Oh, whatever.

00:18:43.522 --> 00:18:44.819
He's such a ditz.

00:18:49.495 --> 00:18:51.156
What am I doing?

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:52.220
Hey, Mizutani.

00:18:52.698 --> 00:18:53.563
What?

00:18:55.334 --> 00:18:56.699
Last shot.

00:18:57.202 --> 00:18:59.296
I can't believe you took me like that.

00:18:59.438 --> 00:19:01.549
Don't develop it, okay?

00:19:01.573 --> 00:19:03.871
No, it's a good picture.

00:19:04.776 --> 00:19:06.287
Don't develop it, okay?

00:19:06.311 --> 00:19:07.922
No promises.

00:19:07.946 --> 00:19:08.811
No!

00:19:25.964 --> 00:19:26.931
You're late.

00:19:32.671 --> 00:19:34.435
| just finished.

00:19:57.563 --> 00:19:58.428
Thanks.

00:19:59.565 --> 00:20:01.090
To be honest...

00:20:02.935 --> 00:20:05.461
...hate the rain.

00:20:06.104 --> 00:20:07.128
| thought so.

00:20:07.239 --> 00:20:08.900
Shoot. So you knew.

00:20:13.111 --> 00:20:14.909
The last shot again?

00:20:18.483 --> 00:20:20.577
No, that was the first.

00:20:29.728 --> 00:20:32.698
No one can stop the flow of time...

00:20:34.833 --> 00:20:41.296
...but a moment captured in a
picture will never disappear.

